+"""Rules v0.5 "blind" as dials (docs/DETECT.md): `hide_roles` and `clue_round_pct`.
+
+Both are off by default and must then change nothing. `Defaults` pins that two ways: against a
+digest made from the code as it was before the dials (`tests/fixtures/v05_defaults/digest.json`,
+written by `tests/dump_default_play.py --root <the untouched copy>`), and, when an untouched copy
+of the code is at hand, by playing the same seeded games in both copies and comparing every prompt
+and every log line.
+"""
+
